`0-kernel-programming-principles.md` (`status: from documentation`, scope `gfx942/gfx950`) is principles ordered by how often each is violated, each with a quantified check answerable from source / the compiler resource report / a sixty-second test, plus its exceptions. It does mention gfx1250 (one of the 19 files that do).

